      "text": "Database Migration Service with continuous replication for PostgreSQL",
      "explanation": "This managed migration service moves PostgreSQL data from on premises to Cloud SQL or AlloyDB and supports ongoing replication to minimize downtime",
      "correct": true,
      "selected": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL",
      "explanation": "This is a fully managed PostgreSQL service that serves as a destination for migrated databases and offers high availability features",
      "correct": false,
      "selected": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Datastream",
      "explanation": "This serverless change data capture service streams database changes into Google Cloud destinations for integration and analytics",
      "correct": false,
