  "tip": "<p>When you see requirements for very low downtime with continuous replication and a structured cutover, choose the managed migration service. If the option is about the destination database or a general ETL product, reconsider because those do not provide the end to end migration workflow. Focus on <i>continuous replication</i>, <i>validation</i>, and <i>cutover</i> keywords to guide your choice.</p>",
